Based on analysis from the codebase, it seems that `raw: true` is consistently used for code editing operations. This pattern is established in `core/edit/recursiveStream.ts` line 33 and `core/autocomplete/generation/CompletionStreamer.ts` line 41

More importantly, raw: true is technically superior for code editing use cases because it sends prompts directly to the LLM without template processing, ensuring precise control over the instructions. This prevents any intermediate formatting that could interfere with the carefully crafted prompts needed for accurate code replacement and generation.

